        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "title",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## Iceberg REST catalog: when do 429s start?\n\n",
                "Probe runs against a transient sandbox workspace. Each run ramps one endpoint in steps, holds above the onset, then drops to a trickle. **Onset** = first step with >= 5% 429s. One environment, one point in time: compare shapes, don't treat the numbers as an SLA.\n\n",
                "**Pick one Run first**: with All selected the charts add every run together.\n\n"
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 6,
            "height": 2
          }
